    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Midgar, every life is a new beginning, but for Drassil, it is an opportunity to evolve and adapt like never before. Train under the guidance of your mother Freyja, until a fateful confrontation with the serpent Jormungand leads you on an epic journey across diverse continents and biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cycle of Reincarnation and Evolution:</strong> The central gameplay loop revolves around the unique concept of transferring life energy to the &quot;Trees of Life.&quot; Upon death or meditation, Drassil can choose to reincarnate through these trees, inheriting new abilities adapted to the biome where he is reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adaptive Genetics:</strong> Utilize a detailed genetics system to adapt to a wide variety of environments, from hot deserts to cold tundras. With 6 chromosomes affecting different aspects of your character, customization is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 Unique Biomes:</strong> Each biome presents its own challenges and creatures. From deserts to tundras and swamps, adaptation is vital for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complex Combat System:</strong> Experience deep combat with a wide variety of weapons and unique genetic abilities. Each enemy requires a different strategy, and your evolutionary abilities will play a pivotal role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day and Night System and Weather Cycle:</strong> Weather patterns and the day-night cycle affect the world's behavior around you, adding an additional layer of complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enveloping Narrative:</strong> Uncover pieces of Midgar's hidden history and your own mysterious past as you progress through your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolve, adapt, and survive in this dynamic and ever-changing world. Are you ready to face the challenges of &quot;Genimas: Life Reborn&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genetic Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Genetic Body:</strong> This gene changes Drassil's body to adapt it to different extreme environments such as extreme temperatures, high pressures, underwater, poisonous atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985980/extras/fff1bb10d3b96514d6d8b629e14183e3.avif?t=1743446587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Genetic Eyes:</strong> This gene activates Drassil's visual powers, allowing you to see invisible enemies, dangers, hidden paths, hidden places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985980/extras/8dc6a8f06a063bd86230a424198b4987.avif?t=1743446587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Left Arm Genetics:</strong> The genetics of the left arm transform the arm into different tools or weapons, which serve to solve the puzzles of the dungeons or defeat invulnerable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985980/extras/21a1bbb3da7589707e03ebfd87a5969f.avif?t=1743446587\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leg Genetics:</strong> Leg genetics affect the character's movement in the world; they are designed to run faster, double-jump, move through quicksand without sinking, move on ice without slipping, and move fluidly underwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of Midgar, every life is a new beginning, but for Drassil, it is an opportunity to evolve and adapt like never before. Train under the guidance of your mother Freyja, until a fateful confrontation with the serpent Jormungand leads you on an epic journey across diverse continents and biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cycle of Reincarnation and Evolution:</strong> The central gameplay loop revolves around the unique concept of transferring life energy to the &quot;Trees of Life.&quot; Upon death or meditation, Drassil can choose to reincarnate through these trees, inheriting new abilities adapted to the biome where he is reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adaptive Genetics:</strong> Utilize a detailed genetics system to adapt to a wide variety of environments, from hot deserts to cold tundras. With 6 chromosomes affecting different aspects of your character, customization is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 Unique Biomes:</strong> Each biome presents its own challenges and creatures. From deserts to tundras and swamps, adaptation is vital for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complex Combat System:</strong> Experience deep combat with a wide variety of weapons and unique genetic abilities. Each enemy requires a different strategy, and your evolutionary abilities will play a pivotal role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day and Night System and Weather Cycle:</strong> Weather patterns and the day-night cycle affect the world's behavior around you, adding an additional layer of complexity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enveloping Narrative:</strong> Uncover pieces of Midgar's hidden history and your own myste